{"summary":"A classic, sci-fi, point & adventure game in outer space","description":"Space! Dexter Stardust barely escaped when the Vreesians, inhabitants of the menacing Planet X, sent a fleet of robots to destroy all life on Earth. Now, twenty years later, a mechanical man from the 10th planet seeks to communicate with Dexter a very important message - he is the key to saving both humans and Vreesians! Play the taco-loving Dexter Stardust as he, and his good friend Aurora, go on the greatest adventure of their lives and discover the mystery of the Robot from the Planet X!\n\n• 5 Episodes all in one game! Plays like a Saturday Morning Cartoon.\n• Fully voiced.\n• A true classic graphic adventure game with traditional point and click mechanics. This is a 100% pure graphic adventure!\n• All traditional - frame by frame - animation. No rigged characters!\n• Artwork created in 4K.\n• Visit 5 planets with well over 100 playable scenes.\n• Lots of puzzles. Learn to play the ukulele.\n• Tacos!\n• Exclamation points!","esrbNotes":"Comic Mischief","pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uQJYqPHvHjE?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WEdsqZrE5tuwSAtjEK57gX008-qYOVeLH3e6lNI5Xx4MUHoNA_z-DQwhymSdrUz8GAylpFmY8aqe_G7TjBZ0_Y8","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Q9apDnCMIFmJUYOj7aHaCuzd8xtofj6a1QmeWmiqhoMOYAFHVXh7b5YSVpvw7mmiENsn4w4_CAJVvxKIx8OM","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8AeNtpGaNu_e1wnCmUg_9iRPG0yAh_TGh8f6mMd9BzpS-1bVJ30UANUJDl8jLS1kRaoUj1VA5JsarIGIMyDQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UGzYXu25aIXUFbQOA_eZ5LL_J9UCeN16p94JrXEem_WnPFuUFPz_Ph9rRlrhfo4XnFTe0STGxB4bq2Tf3d-DsA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NJ7hE3LeSb33cqWpMDOa0uxuuWnB7QQOpm8fXo8iSw4ODL-KtPREXxvRRMcMGar1P-4hWtn4ePjlzk22spJumA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nr584qk05VYH53ljgxrJpDcNW66ummoYX-uRytjzu7LzQqegg_kowj4tvVE_qPIWj6Z7KUViI70mJ3ozVP3vWA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com